{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10002_01_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:336ababac562bd4e41dda46491265cd4b5bbe341b8e5e830d4e0ea45ab17b045",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000019:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:edf50819d11184bc1b291a041e362119951343f91355754d115770cf9f6bde85",
      "text": "新闻资讯环节",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff3c5470186ee4146504fc52ce78688fb87c54dbe99f5074d10ff844c14dedd",
      "text": "前自卫官独到的防范对策建议，\n非常感谢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7fb012822d615a61d95f8b48bc0e42434eb6929fd921f8803b0ca096d89f541d",
      "text": "我的知识能够派上用场真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9b5879f1fdf2aae4be8a83136ad4fe58da1198011d22fe5015303320aa240a3",
      "text": "除了刚才介绍的之外，防范对策还有很多。\n请各家各户都采取有效的防范手段。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9377fa2991295edde4a98c1d2fc4e64ef82518a02d594aa092d082d9cf51d45",
      "text": "电视机前的各位观众，为了每天的安全着想，\n请大家再次重新审视一下防范方面的工作吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000043:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a367918c73c15adc5fd4bf80266dcfd51e84da44ae17739cd7ade7886decb96f",
      "text": "天气预报环节",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e4228f94b17619eb1587affb57a0256dfda63fbca276fa78f3601ac9fe6bee51",
      "text": "7月到10月的火灾发生起数其实很少。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d35cad1c9db1ef4be6d80752111738ca2373ed2801c5c06b359c7140641e682a",
      "text": "因为是多雨且湿度较高的时期，\n大家很容易掉以轻心……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:208ef3f554ebc20eea8dce923e7b059c6307fadd4c89cf854e017cf31f02e9d7",
      "text": "但为了能够从容应对各种突发情况，\n请大家务必积极参加防灾训练哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000062:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60dfb457ee0a72483c0d53b9508e4d399b62c932bde19b4d1936a2d24d2e3049",
      "text": "烦恼咨询环节",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000070:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d9facb6ca8efef0e95b37e78d716c09869736abd5f02d822a7a9f0fce4c3029",
      "text": "虽然无法全部回答，但非常感谢大家送来的\n那么多来信！最后请容我传达这句话。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d794e477d4ac8c1b3ed86940ea9a8aceb01f2455b9fb530aba7091bf7f6fecb",
      "text": "或许会有感到孤独或不安的时候。\n但是，你们绝对不是孤身一人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:076301f38efc920eca52b1be72aa63df157166244483ebf3fda49c0c8502153f",
      "text": "我们无论何时，都是大家的后盾。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10002_01:1_3_10002_01_i:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d56b3670035e0e9955ff1060b3f9bfd45c15488c68654840ea5f912a697eb6c",
      "text": "如果遇上了什么事，希望你们能想起我们。\n一言为定哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
